docs/lumos-toolchain-knowledge/Systems/bound-tests-gate.md:18:  KEY:★INVARIANT★ code-loop check 對 impact 固定席上合約綁的測試逐支真跑,任一紅/懸空(dangling/fake)/方法名不合法/★證不出跑過(unfilterable)★ → blocked=True rc1;沒 run_cmd/diff 算不出/無固定席/沒綁 → 不擋但寫 gate=bound-tests 帳 [test:t_bound_tests_gate] [audit:sonnet/2026-08-22]
